  "estimatedMinutes": 1,
  "statement": "If for any three distinct numbers \\(a,\\) \\(b,\\) and \\(c\\) we define \\[ \\boxed{a,b,c}=\\frac{c+a}{c-b}, \\] then \\(\\boxed{1,-2,-3}=\\)",
